<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates unchanged at 4.00-4.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates unchanged at 4.00-4.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar were unchanged on Wednesday at 4.00-4.50 percent, bankers said. They said excess dinar liquidity within the banking sector was maintaining a downward pressure on rates.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
